Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: run gates with frozen workspace dependencies

Since v1.4.221 upstream's ensure-native-runtime resolves node-gyp from the
workspace itself, so that part is upstream's; only the e2e build setup's direct
electron-vite invocation stays carried.

Carried-Because: Confined builds must not invoke package-manager resolution while running tools.
Tests: tests/e2e/status-bar-provider-account-meters.spec.ts, whose global setup runs the carried invocation; all declared HarnessOS gates.

diff --git a/tests/e2e/global-setup.ts b/tests/e2e/global-setup.ts
index 60a4642e4d66c99c952976b9bf5a9e7ce4ac869b..25d214ae59f5dc5a109701739c8908682c307254 100644
--- a/tests/e2e/global-setup.ts
